{"sections": [
  {"key": "arc", "title": "The arc", "sentences": [
    {"type": "fact", "text": "Revenue compounded at 3.8% a year from FY2016 to FY2025, reaching $31.7 billion [F198][F9]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating income grew faster, at a 5.8% CAGR to $8.6 billion, lifting operating margin from 22.9% to 27.2% [F199][F19][F20][F28]."},
