    {"type": "cause", "text": "FY2020 was the trough, with net income down 63.3% on coal ash settlement impairments and pandemic-driven volume losses [D157][P60]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "drivers", "title": "What drove growth", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Electric Utilities and Infrastructure supplied 90.9% of FY2025 revenue and 3.6pp of the 5.6% growth [D541][D543][D358]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Residential electric was the largest single driver, contributing 2.8pp on 6.6% growth and 43.3% of revenue [D776][D775][D774]."},
