    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating costs grew 0.3pp slower than revenue in FY2025, at 5.3%, and incremental operating margin was 41.4% [D379][D372][D378]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Diluted EPS rose 10.5% against 9.8% net income growth as the diluted share count rose 0.6% [D362][D360][D374]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "margins", "title": "Margins and costs", "sentences": [
