    {"type": "comparison", "text": "The margin rose 0.8pp in FY2025, while D&A climbed to 24.3% of revenue from 21.4% [D370][D341][D303]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "In FY2025 net margin of 15.7% sat 11.5pp below the 27.2% operating margin, as interest expense of $3.6 billion and an 11.2% effective tax rate absorbed the gap [F47][F28][D967][X63][D345]."},
    {"type": "judgement", "text": "The margin expansion looks structural, built on rate-case recovery and a growing regulated asset base rather than cost cuts [P16][P25]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "cash", "title": "Cash conversion", "sentences": [
