    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Capex of $14.0 billion was 44.2% of revenue and 1.82x D&A [F87][D342][D348]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "FY2022 conversion fell to 20.7% of revenue as rising fuel costs created undercollections financed with borrowings [D224][P36]."}
  ]},
